{# THE sell-side printed/PDF document card — the ".invoice-document" every Sales Order, Invoice
   and Quote (admin and customer) renders, shared rather than copied three and a half times.

   is_pdf already made these one file per document type in the SENSE that screen and PDF share a
   template (dompdf renders the same twig with is_pdf: true); this partial is the other half —
   the three DOCUMENT TYPES sharing the same markup and the same CSS, with only the genuinely
   different business content left to each caller. Modelled directly on
   admin/_partials/sales_detail_line_table.html.twig's own rule for the VIEW-screen line table:
   one column list and one row loop, real differences as parameters, nothing here that posts and
   nothing that branches on which of the three documents this is.

   ## What stays different, and why (the same distinctions sales_order.html.twig's own docblock,
   written before this partial existed, already drew)

     - An Order shows Ordered/Invoiced/Remaining, never a plain Quantity, and never Amount Due,
       payment status or amount received: nothing is owed on an order, the invoice raised
       against it is what asks for money.
     - An Invoice shows Batch (the lot actually shipped) and the money block; an order has no lot
       to name because nothing has been picked against IT, and a quote has ordered nothing.
     - A Quote may leave shipping/price/tax/total genuinely unstated ("TBD" — #255): a quote is
       priced incrementally and a stated $0.00 would tell the customer the goods are free.

   Everything else — the header band, the seller/buyer meta layout, the address boxes, the line
   table's shared columns and their order, the fee-line rows beside the products, the totals
   table's shared rows, and every pixel of the CSS — is now ONE shape for all three, including the
   customer's own quote PDF, which used to be a fourth, visually unrelated document.

   Parameters
   ----------
   docLabel           required  'SALES ORDER' | 'INVOICE' | 'QUOTE' — the header band's right side.
   sectionTitle       required  'Ordered Items' | 'Products' — the line table's own heading.
   metaLeftTemplate   required  a template path rendering the LEFT meta column's own fields (order
                                number/date/status vs invoice number/due date/sales order vs quote
                                number/status) — a path, not parameters, for the same reason
                                sales_detail_line_table.html.twig's footTemplate is: a handful of
                                conditional rows, not a value.
   metaLeftContext    required  what metaLeftTemplate is rendered with.
   billingAddress     required  ?AbstractDocumentAddress — the frozen snapshot, or null.
   shippingAddress    required  ?AbstractDocumentAddress
   billingFallbackName   required  the bold name printed when billingAddress is null.
   shippingFallbackName  required  the bold name printed when shippingAddress is null.
   companyIdentityName   required  the buyer's own company name — address-box fallback body line,
                                    and the phone/email fallback when the address carries none.
   companyIdentityPhone  required
   companyIdentityEmail  required
   lineColumns        required  ordered list of column keys this document's table carries. Known
                                keys: 'ordered', 'invoiced', 'remaining', 'qty', 'name', 'unit',
                                'sku', 'price', 'subtotal', 'batch'. The header, the empty/fee row
                                colspans and the column widths all read this ONE list, so a table
                                cannot end up one cell out of alignment.
   lines              required  the document's lines, in sortOrder.
   document           required  the order/invoice/estimate itself — 'ordered'/'invoiced'/
                                'remaining' read `document.invoicedQuantityInLineUnitFor(line)` /
                                `uninvoicedQuantityInLineUnitFor(line)` off it (SalesOrder only;
                                the column key is simply never in `lineColumns` for the other two).
   allowUnpriced      optional  true to print TBD instead of a dollar figure wherever a line's
                                price/subtotal, or a totals row, is null (#255). Quote only.
                                Defaults to false.
   feeLinesJson       required  the document's own feeLines column, undecoded — decoded once here,
                                and split by placement here too: `before_tax_line`/`after_tax_line`
                                rows for the totals table, `main_line` rows folded into the product
                                table and its own subtotal. One caller passing one raw column beats
                                three each replicating the same placement filter.
   footerNoteTemplate required  a template path for the footer's LEFT note (customer note / a
                                static sentence / an app_setting), a path for the same reason
                                metaLeftTemplate is.
   footerNoteContext  required
   subtotal           required  the document's own subtotal — a float, or null on an unpriced quote.
   shippingTotal      required  float, or null.
   shippingLines      required  list of {label, amount} — already filtered to shipping-type rows.
   taxLines           required  list of {label, rate, amount} from the tax breakdown.
   tax                required  float, or null.
   grandTotalLabel    required  'ORDER VALUE:' | 'TOTAL:' — the one row wording a Sales Order and
                                an Invoice/Quote have never agreed on, and do not need to: it names
                                what the figure beneath it actually is.
   total              required  float, or null.
   showMoneyBlock     optional  true to add Amount received / AMOUNT DUE / payment status under
                                the grand total. Invoice only. Defaults to false.
   amountPaid / balance / paymentStatusLabel   required when showMoneyBlock is true.
   injectionPointName    optional  'invoice_note' | 'quote_note' | null — an order carries none.
   injectionPointContext optional  what the injection point is called with. Defaults to {}.
   extraSectionTemplate  optional  a template path rendered inside invoice-body, after the totals
                                table — the order's own "Invoices Raised" list. Nothing else has
                                one, so this is null everywhere else.
   extraSectionContext   optional  what extraSectionTemplate is rendered with. Defaults to {}.
   globalFooterNoteText  optional  a centred, full-width note below the totals table entirely —
                                `invoice_footer_note`, the one app setting only the invoice reads.
                                Defaults to '' (renders nothing).
#}
{%- set _feeLines = feeLinesJson|default('')|json_decode -%}
{%- set _feeLinesBeforeTax = _feeLines|filter(f => (f.placement|default('main_line')) == 'before_tax_line') -%}
{%- set _feeLinesAfterTax = _feeLines|filter(f => (f.placement|default('main_line')) == 'after_tax_line') -%}
{%- set _feeLinesMainLineTotal = 0 -%}
{%- for _feeLine in _feeLines -%}
    {%- if (_feeLine.placement|default('main_line')) == 'main_line' and (_feeLine.type|default('fee')) != 'shipping' -%}
        {%- set _feeLinesMainLineTotal = _feeLinesMainLineTotal + _feeLine.amount -%}
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- set _columnWidths = {
    ordered: '8%', invoiced: '9%', remaining: '9%',
    qty: '9%', name: '34%', unit: '9%', sku: '11%',
    price: '12%', subtotal: '13%', batch: '12%',
}-%}
{%- set _columnLabels = {
    ordered: 'Ordered', invoiced: 'Invoiced', remaining: 'Remaining',
    qty: 'Quantity', name: 'Product Name and Description', unit: 'U/M', sku: 'SKU',
    price: 'Price', subtotal: 'Total', batch: 'Batch',
}-%}
{%- set _columnAlign = {price: 'right', subtotal: 'right'}-%}
<div class="invoice-page-container">
    <div class="invoice-document shadow-lg">

        {# Header band, slim on purpose (issue #35): the line-items table has to start high on
           page 1, so the title bar carries text only, no logo tile. #}
        <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background:#0f172a;border-collapse:collapse;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact;">
            <tr>
                <td width="65%" style="background:#0f172a;padding:7px 16px;vertical-align:middle;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact;">
                    <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;">{{ site_name() }}</span>
                </td>
                <td width="35%" style="background:#0f172a;padding:7px 16px;vertical-align:middle;text-align:right;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;letter-spacing:-0.02em;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact;">{{ docLabel }}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="invoice-body">

            {# Meta 3-col: the document's own facts (left, doc-specific), then the seller's
               identity — every line an admin setting (Settings → Company Information), and
               nothing here ever falls back to the BUYER's details: a blank setting omits the
               line rather than naming the wrong party. #}
            <table class="inv-meta-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                    <td class="inv-meta-col">
                        {{ include(metaLeftTemplate, metaLeftContext, with_context = false) }}
                    </td>
                    <td class="inv-meta-col">
                        {% if app_setting('company_name', '') %}<p><strong>{{ app_setting('company_name', '') }}</strong></p>{% endif %}
                        {% if app_setting('company_address', '') %}<p>{{ app_setting('company_address', '') }}</p>{% endif %}
                        {% set _cityLine = [app_setting('company_city', ''), province_name(app_setting('company_country', ''), app_setting('company_state', ''))]|filter(v => v)|join(', ') %}
                        {% if _cityLine %}<p>{{ _cityLine }}</p>{% endif %}
                        {% if app_setting('company_postal_code', '') %}<p>{{ app_setting('company_postal_code', '') }}</p>{% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td class="inv-meta-col" style="text-align:right;">
                        {% set _sellerPhone = app_setting('company_phone', '') %}
                        {% set _sellerEmail = app_setting('sales_email', '') ?: app_setting('app_email', '') %}
                        {% if _sellerPhone %}<p><strong>Phone:</strong> {{ _sellerPhone }}</p>{% endif %}
                        {% if _sellerEmail %}<p><strong>Email:</strong> {{ _sellerEmail }}</p>{% endif %}
                        <p><strong>Website:</strong> {{ app_setting('website_url', app.request.schemeAndHttpHost) }}</p>
                        <p><strong>GST Number:</strong> {{ app_setting('company_gst_number', '') ?: '-' }}</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            {# Customer information — the frozen snapshot, never a live company lookup, or a
               document reprinted after a rebrand would name a customer who never saw this. #}
            <div class="invoice-section-title">Customer Information</div>
            <table class="inv-addr-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                    <td class="address-box">
                        <h3>Bill To:</h3>
                        {% if billingAddress %}
                            <p><strong>{{ billingAddress.companyName|default(billingFallbackName) }}</strong></p>
                            <p>{{ billingAddress.addressLine1 }}</p>
                            {% if billingAddress.addressLine2 %}<p>{{ billingAddress.addressLine2 }}</p>{% endif %}
                            <p>{{ billingAddress.city }}, {{ province_name(billingAddress.country, billingAddress.province) }} {{ billingAddress.postalCode }}</p>
                            <p>{{ country_name(billingAddress.country) }}</p>
                            <p style="margin-top:10px;"><strong>Phone:</strong> {{ billingAddress.phone|default(companyIdentityPhone) }}</p>
                            <p><strong>Email:</strong> {{ billingAddress.emailPrimary|default(companyIdentityEmail) }}</p>
                        {% else %}
                            <p><strong>{{ billingFallbackName|default(companyIdentityName) }}</strong></p>
                            <p>{{ companyIdentityName }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td class="address-box">
                        <h3>Ship To:</h3>
                        {% if shippingAddress %}
                            <p><strong>{{ shippingAddress.companyName|default(shippingFallbackName) }}</strong></p>
                            <p>{{ shippingAddress.addressLine1 }}</p>
                            {% if shippingAddress.addressLine2 %}<p>{{ shippingAddress.addressLine2 }}</p>{% endif %}
                            <p>{{ shippingAddress.city }}, {{ province_name(shippingAddress.country, shippingAddress.province) }} {{ shippingAddress.postalCode }}</p>
                            <p>{{ country_name(shippingAddress.country) }}</p>
                            {% if shippingAddress.deliveryInstructions %}<p style="margin-top:6px;"><strong>Delivery:</strong> {{ shippingAddress.deliveryInstructions }}</p>{% endif %}
                            <p style="margin-top:10px;"><strong>Phone:</strong> {{ shippingAddress.phone|default(companyIdentityPhone) }}</p>
                            <p><strong>Email:</strong> {{ shippingAddress.emailPrimary|default(companyIdentityEmail) }}</p>
                        {% else %}
                            <p><strong>{{ shippingFallbackName|default(companyIdentityName) }}</strong></p>
                            <p>{{ companyIdentityName }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            {# Line items. #}
            <div class="invoice-section-title">{{ sectionTitle }}</div>
            <table class="invoice-table" style="width:100%;table-layout:fixed;">
                <colgroup>
                    {% for key in lineColumns %}
                        <col style="width:{{ _columnWidths[key] }};">
                    {% endfor %}
                </colgroup>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        {% for key in lineColumns %}
                            <th{% if _columnAlign[key] is defined %} style="text-align:{{ _columnAlign[key] }};"{% endif %}>{{ _columnLabels[key] }}</th>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for line in lines %}
                        <tr>
                            {% for key in lineColumns %}
                                {%- if key == 'ordered' -%}
                                    <td id="doc-line-qty-{{ line.id }}">{{ line.quantityEntered|qty }}</td>
                                {%- elseif key == 'invoiced' -%}
                                    <td>{{ document.invoicedQuantityInLineUnitFor(line)|qty }}</td>
                                {%- elseif key == 'remaining' -%}
                                    <td>{{ document.uninvoicedQuantityInLineUnitFor(line)|qty }}</td>
                                {%- elseif key == 'qty' -%}
                                    <td id="doc-line-qty-{{ line.id }}">{{ line.quantityEntered|qty }}</td>
                                {%- elseif key == 'name' -%}
                                    <td><strong>{{ line.name }}</strong></td>
                                {%- elseif key == 'unit' -%}
                                    <td>{{ line.displayUnitLabel }}</td>
                                {%- elseif key == 'sku' -%}
                                    <td>{{ line.sku|default('-') }}</td>
                                {%- elseif key == 'price' -%}
                                    <td style="text-align:right;" id="doc-line-price-{{ line.id }}">{% if allowUnpriced|default(false) %}{{ line.displayUnitPrice is not null ? '$' ~ line.displayUnitPrice|price : 'TBD' }}{% else %}${{ line.displayUnitPrice|price }}{% endif %}</td>
                                {%- elseif key == 'subtotal' -%}
                                    <td style="text-align:right;">{% if allowUnpriced|default(false) %}{{ line.subtotal is not null ? '$' ~ line.subtotal|amount : 'TBD' }}{% else %}${{ line.subtotal|amount }}{% endif %}</td>
                                {%- elseif key == 'batch' -%}
                                    <td style="white-space: normal; word-break: break-word; line-height: 1.25;">{{ line.batch|default('-') }}</td>
                                {%- endif -%}
                            {% endfor %}
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                    {# A main-line, non-shipping charge is a line item too, listed beside the
                       products it was billed with. #}
                    {% for feeLine in _feeLines %}
                        {% if feeLine.placement|default('main_line') == 'main_line' and feeLine.type|default('fee') != 'shipping' %}
                            <tr>
                                {% for key in lineColumns %}
                                    {%- if key == 'name' -%}
                                        <td><strong>{{ feeLine.label }}</strong></td>
                                    {%- elseif key == 'subtotal' -%}
                                        <td style="text-align:right;">${{ feeLine.amount|amount }}</td>
                                    {%- else -%}
                                        <td{% if _columnAlign[key] is defined %} style="text-align:{{ _columnAlign[key] }};"{% endif %}>&mdash;</td>
                                    {%- endif -%}
                                {% endfor %}
                            </tr>
                        {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>

            {# Footer: note (left, doc-specific) + totals (right, shared shape). #}
            <table class="inv-footer-table" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                    <td class="footer-note">
                        {{ include(footerNoteTemplate, footerNoteContext, with_context = false) }}
                    </td>
                    <td class="footer-totals">
                        <table class="totals-inner" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                            <tr><td>Product Subtotal:</td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>{{ subtotal is not null ? '$' ~ subtotal|amount : 'TBD' }}</strong></td></tr>
                            {# One row per shipping line, labelled as entered; a summed stand-in
                               row appears when the document has none, so a document never simply
                               omits shipping. `shipping-fee-row` is the hook every caller of this
                               partial addresses it by (#254). #}
                            {% if shippingLines is empty %}
                                <tr class="shipping-fee-row"><td>Shipping Fee:</td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>{{ allowUnpriced|default(false) ? 'TBD' : '$0.00' }}</strong></td></tr>
                            {% endif %}
                            {% for shippingLine in shippingLines %}
                                <tr class="shipping-fee-row"><td>{{ shippingLine.label }}:</td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>${{ shippingLine.amount|amount }}</strong></td></tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                            {# TBD only when the figure it sums is itself unknown: an unpriced
                               subtotal, or (quote only) shipping not yet decided — never merely
                               because shippingTotal happens to be null on an order/invoice that
                               simply has no shipping, which `?? 0` already covers. #}
                            {%- set _subtotalExclTaxesTbd = subtotal is null or (allowUnpriced|default(false) and shippingTotal is null) -%}
                            <tr class="subtotal-excl-taxes-row"><td>Subtotal excl. taxes:</td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>{{ not _subtotalExclTaxesTbd ? '$' ~ (subtotal + (shippingTotal ?? 0) + _feeLinesMainLineTotal)|amount : 'TBD' }}</strong></td></tr>
                            {% for feeLine in _feeLinesBeforeTax %}
                                <tr><td>{{ feeLine.label }}:</td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>${{ feeLine.amount|amount }}</strong></td></tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                            {% for taxLine in taxLines %}
                                <tr><td>{{ taxLine.label }}{% if taxLine.rate is not null %} {{ (taxLine.rate * 100)|number_format(0) }}%{% endif %}:</td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>${{ taxLine.amount|amount }}</strong></td></tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                            <tr><td>Total Tax:</td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>{{ tax is not null ? '$' ~ tax|amount : 'TBD' }}</strong></td></tr>
                            {% for feeLine in _feeLinesAfterTax %}
                                <tr><td>{{ feeLine.label }}:</td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>${{ feeLine.amount|amount }}</strong></td></tr>
                            {% endfor %}
                            <tr class="grand-total-row"><td><strong>{{ grandTotalLabel }}</strong></td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>{{ total is not null ? '$' ~ total|amount : 'TBD' }}</strong></td></tr>
                            {% if showMoneyBlock|default(false) %}
                                {# The money block. Both figures come off the invoice's own payment
                                   rows, never summed here — a template that added the payments up
                                   itself would be a second answer able to disagree with the status
                                   beside it. #}
                                <tr><td>Amount received:</td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>${{ amountPaid|amount }}</strong></td></tr>
                                <tr class="amount-due-row"><td><strong>AMOUNT DUE:</strong></td><td style="text-align:right;"><strong>${{ balance|amount }}</strong></td></tr>
                                <tr><td colspan="2" style="text-align:right; padding-top:3px;">{{ paymentStatusLabel }}</td></tr>
                            {% endif %}
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            {% if globalFooterNoteText|default('') %}
                <p class="invoice-global-footer-note">{{ globalFooterNoteText }}</p>
            {% endif %}

            {% if extraSectionTemplate is defined and extraSectionTemplate is not null %}
                {{ include(extraSectionTemplate, extraSectionContext|default({}), with_context = false) }}
            {% endif %}

            {% if injectionPointName is defined and injectionPointName is not null %}
                {{ injection_point(injectionPointName, injectionPointContext|default({})) }}
            {% endif %}

        </div>{# /invoice-body #}
    </div>{# /invoice-document #}
</div>

<style>
    /*
     * One sizing discipline for every sell-side document (issue #35): print sizes throughout,
     * one sans family, and only normal/bold weights — 800/900 make dompdf fall back to Times
     * (see admin/_main/pdf_layout.html.twig).
     */
    .invoice-page-container { padding: 24px 0 30px; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .invoice-document { background: #fff; border-radius: 4px; color: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }
    .invoice-body { padding: 12px 16px 14px; }
    .invoice-document tbody tr:hover,
    .invoice-document tbody tr:hover td { background: transparent !important; }

    .inv-meta-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .inv-meta-col { width: 33.33%; vertical-align: top; font-size: 8.5px; line-height: 1.35; padding-right: 14px; }
    .inv-meta-col:last-child { padding-right: 0; }
    .inv-meta-col p { margin: 0; }

    .invoice-section-title { font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e3a8a; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; padding-bottom: 2px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 10px; }

    .inv-addr-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .address-box { width: 50%; vertical-align: top; padding-right: 14px; }
    .address-box:last-child { padding-right: 0; }
    .address-box h3 { font-size: 9px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e3a8a; margin: 0 0 3px 0; }
    .address-box p { margin: 0; font-size: 8.5px; line-height: 1.35; }

    .invoice-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .invoice-table th { text-align: left; background: #f8fafc; padding: 4px 6px; font-size: 8px; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 2px solid #334155; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
    .invoice-table td { padding: 4px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 8.5px; line-height: 1.3; }

    .inv-footer-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
    .footer-note { vertical-align: top; font-size: 8.5px; color: #475569; padding-right: 20px; padding-top: 6px; line-height: 1.35; }
    .footer-note-block { margin: 0 0 5px 0; }
    .footer-totals { vertical-align: top; width: 230px; border-top: 1px solid #334155; padding-top: 6px; }
    .invoice-global-footer-note { width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: center; font-size: 8.5px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.35; }
    .totals-inner { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .totals-inner td { font-size: 8.5px; padding: 1px 0; }
    .grand-total-row { border-top: 2px solid #334155; }
    .grand-total-row td { font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e3a8a; padding-top: 5px; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
    .amount-due-row { border-top: 1px solid #334155; }
    .amount-due-row td { font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #b42318; padding-top: 3px; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }

    @media print {
        * { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important; print-color-adjust: exact !important; }
        html, body { background: #fff !important; margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; }
        .topbar, .site-footer, .admin-content-header, .no-print, .breadcrumbs,
        header, footer, nav, aside, .skip-link, .toast, .delete-modal-overlay, .flash-messages { display: none !important; }
        .app-shell, .content-frame, #main-content, .invoice-page-container {
            display: block !important; padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;
            width: 100% !important; max-width: none !important; border: none !important;
            box-shadow: none !important; background: #fff !important;
        }
        .invoice-document { border: none !important; box-shadow: none !important; }
        .address-box, .invoice-section-title { page-break-inside: avoid; }
        .invoice-table tr { page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: auto; }
    }
</style>
